title: "Biological Pauli Holes: analysis code and numerical results"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and numerical results for a study of whether Pauli confinement
  of a transferring hydrogen can contribute to enzyme catalysis, tested in
  soybean lipoxygenase.
type: software
